      "comment": "HIJINKERY (6) quickly away to win over the 530m at Angle Park two runs back then prominent throughout when finishing second at this track last start. Good form should continue. ADHANA SNAPPY (7) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 4.5 lengths back in second (30.68) at this track in a OPEN over 531m. Expected to be in the finish again. ECHOES OF DAD (1) was impressive last start despite finishing second, recording a superb 30.71 to place behind Lamia Nonna Mim and clocking a new PB this course and distance. Rates a leading chance if runs up to latest. WILLOW TYSON (2) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can turn the form around.",
